#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Informasi tentang logging IBM Quantum di IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Logging untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Logging untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Layanan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti IBM Quantum Compute Service, menghasilkan log platform yang bisa kamu gunakan untuk menyelidiki aktivitas tidak biasa dan tindakan kritis di akunmu, serta memecahkan masalah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) yang merupakan layanan platform, untuk merutekan log platform di akunmu ke tujuan yang kamu pilih dengan mengonfigurasi tenant yang menentukan ke mana log platform dikirim. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [Tentang Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) untuk memvisualisasikan dan memberi peringatan pada log platform yang dihasilkan di akunmu dan dirutekan oleh IBM Cloud Logs Routing ke instans IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Lokasi tempat log platform dihasilkan {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry menghasilkan log platform yang ditampilkan di instans logging-mu. Tabel berikut mencantumkan lokasi di mana pengumpulan otomatis log layanan Container Registry diaktifkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Lokasi                     | Apakah log layanan platform tersedia? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Ya                   |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Ya                   |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Log platform yang dihasilkan {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service menghasilkan log layanan platform yang ditampilkan di instans logging-mu untuk kasus-kasus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Saat status sebuah job berubah.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Melihat log dari halaman Observability {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang cara membuka antarmuka IBM Cloud Logs, lihat **Launching the UI** di [dokumentasi IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Kolom berdasarkan tipe log {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang kolom yang ada di setiap log platform, lihat [Fields that are included in platform logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Kolom-kolom berikut ada di dalam rekaman log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom           | Tipe     | Deskripsi                                                                      |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Mendefinisikan akun dan instans flow log tempat log dipublikasikan.            |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Mendefinisikan apakah IBM menyimpan salinan rekaman untuk keperluan operasional. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Deskripsi dari log yang dihasilkan.                                            |\n"
